@startuml 02-System_Context
title PENA-Agent — System Context Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

skinparam component {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
}

skinparam database {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #FFFCE8
}

skinparam cloud {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
}

actor User
actor Developer

rectangle "PENA-Agent" as PENA {

  component "Context Manager" as CM
  component "Digest Generator" as DG
  component "Trust Evaluator" as TE
  component "Observability Engine" as OE

}

cloud "LLM Providers" as LLM
cloud "News / RSS Sources" as NEWS
database "Repository Knowledge Base" as KB
database "Observability Artifacts" as OBS

rectangle "GitHub Repository" as GITHUB
rectangle "VS Code + Copilot" as VSCODE

User --> PENA : requests digest\nreviews summaries

Developer --> VSCODE : develops
VSCODE --> GITHUB : syncs specs/code

PENA --> NEWS : retrieves articles
PENA --> LLM : summarizes\nanalyzes\nranks

PENA --> KB : loads context
PENA --> OBS : stores runtime observations

OE --> OBS : metrics\nlogs\nreports

GITHUB --> KB : specifications\nplans\nlearning artifacts

note bottom of KB
Context is treated as:
- organizational memory
- semantic grounding
- AI operational context
end note

@enduml
